The three triangle inequalities:
- $(2x+9) + (3x-1) > 7x - 4 \iff x < 6$;
- $(2x+9) + (7x-4) > 3x - 1 \iff x > -1$;
- $(3x-1) + (7x-4) > 2x + 9 \iff x > \frac74$.

So $\frac74 < x < 6$, i.e. $x \in \{2, 3, 4, 5\}$, and each gives positive side lengths.

**Answer: 4**
